 "title": "Recorder Resources | Sioux County, Iowa",
 "text": "Recorder Resources | Sioux County, Iowa\nSkip to content\nMenu Elected Officials Attorney – Legal Counsel, Criminal Prosecution, Juvenile Justice\nAuditor – Tax Rates & Levies, Budgets, Real Estate Transfers\nRecorder – Real Estate Records, Permits, Licenses\nTreasurer – Vehicle Registrations, Driver’s Licenses, Tax Statements\nSheriff – Law Enforcement, Jail, Comm Center\nClose\nDepartments Assessor\nAttorney\nAuditor\nClerk of Court\nPublic Health\nConservation Board\nElections\nEmergency Management\nEngineer\nCommunity Services\nGIS Parcel Search\nGIS\nInformation Technology\nRecorder\nSheriff\nSupervisors\nTreasurer\nVeterans Affairs\nZoning\nClose\nI Want To Get directions to county offices\nLearn about the community\nGet Certified copy of: Birth, Death, or Marriage Certificate\nLicense my boat, snowmobile, ATV\nLearn about Home Base Iowa\nLearn about TITLE VI\nRenew Drivers License\nPassport Application\nApply for a gun permit\nFind the assessed value of my home or business\nGet a map of my property\nRequest GIS Data\nPay my Taxes\nSearch Paid Taxes\nGet Election Information\nRegister to Vote\nFind election results\nRequest an Absentee Ballot\nClose\nMenu Departments Assessor\nAttorney\nAuditor\nClerk of Court\nPublic Health\nConservation Board\nElections\nEmergency Management\nEngineer\nCommunity Services\nGIS Parcel Search\nGIS – Geographic Information Systems\nInformation Technology\nRecorder\nSheriff\nSupervisors\nTreasurer\nVeterans Affairs\nZoning\nClose\nOnline Services Assessment Search\nGIS Website\nProperty Tax Payments\nMotor Vehicle Registration\nPublic Access to Local Government Budgets\nDriver’s License Appointments\nClose\nElections\nMinutes\nAbout\nContact\nI Want To Get directions to county offices\nLearn about the community\nGet Certified copy of: Birth, Death, or Marriage Certificate\nLicense my boat, snowmobile, ATV\nApply for a gun permit\nFind the assessed value of my home or business\nGet a map of my property\nPay my Taxes\nGet Election Information\nRegister to Vote\nPast Election Results\nLearn about Home Base Iowa\nClose\nRecorder Resources\nPassport Notice\nBefore coming to the Recorder's Office for passports, please call (712) 737-2229. The hours for accepting applications are 8AM-1PM & 2PM-3:30PM. If the passport Acceptance Agent is not available, your passport application cannot be processed. There are websites masquerading as legitimate government sites and charging people as much as $89 with others fees, to print FREE passport applications. The safest way to apply for a passport is coming into our office to get the forms or printing the form from www.travel.state.gov Make sure to rely on factual information from the U.S. Department of State, where you can find the forms you need for no charge, as well as current processing times and fees. You SHOULD NOT be paying any fees online for passport forms, acceptance fees, etc.\nState of Iowa Marriage Instructions\nIowa Recording Fee Schedule\nState of Iowa Document Format Standards\nGround Water Hazard Instructions\nGround Water Hazard Statement\nDeclaration of Value Form Instructions\nDeclaration of Value Form\nSnow/ATV/ORV/ORM Registration Info\nBoat Registration Info\nPassport Application\nVital Record Information\nRequest For Apostille/Notary Certification Information\nYou will need to register with the site in order to access the land records.\nIowa Land Records\nIowa Transfer Tax Calculator\n210 Central Ave SW\nPO Box 18\nOrange City, IA 51041\n712-737-2216\n© 2026 Sioux County, Iowa • Website by Blue Lake Websites",
